  "dcterms:rights": "DRAFT layered rights model — pending legal sign-off. This dataset is NOT licensed as a whole under MIT. It is a compilation of (a) predominantly third-party legal texts that retain their own source rights (Riigi Teataja statutes/regulations; EU material © European Union, reused under Commission Decision 2011/833/EU, incl. EuroVoc; RIK/Riigikohus and EU Court decisions) and (b) an original compilation layer (selection/arrangement, cross-reference links, minted estleg: IRIs, ontology/TBox structure, controlled vocabularies, derived classifications) which the project offers under CC BY 4.0 (CC0 1.0 an acceptable alternative). Per-distribution dcterms:rights statements below give the source-specific terms. The MIT LICENSE in this repository applies ONLY to the repository software (scripts/, mcp_server/, tests/). Some distributions contain personal data — see estleg:containsPersonalData and docs/DATA_PROTECTION.md. See the top-level NOTICE and docs/DATA_RIGHTS.md. Verify upstream source terms before redistribution.",
  "dcterms:hasPart": {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/estleg/dataset/estonian-legal-ontology#compilation",
    "@type": [
      "dcat:Dataset",
      "dcterms:BibliographicResource"
    ],
    "dcterms:title": "Original compilation layer (estleg)",
    "dcterms:description": "DRAFT pending legal sign-off. The project's own copyrightable / sui-generis-database-right contribution ONLY: the selection & arrangement of the corpus, cross-reference links, minted estleg: IRIs, ontology/TBox structure, controlled vocabularies, and derived classifications — explicitly NOT the third-party legal texts, which retain their source rights (see the per-distribution dcterms:rights, the top-level NOTICE, and docs/DATA_RIGHTS.md). This layer alone is offered under CC BY 4.0 (CC0 1.0 an acceptable alternative). The MIT LICENSE in this repository covers the repository software (scripts/, mcp_server/, tests/) only.",
    "dcterms:license": {
      "@id": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
    },
    "schema:license": {
      "@id": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
